{"sourceUrl":"https://sa.hit.edu.cn/2025/0708/c6582a373316/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:55.650133+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sa.hit.edu.cn/2025/0708/c6582a373316/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>诚挚欢迎全国各高校的优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式来我学科攻读硕士学位研究生（<span>3</span>年制）或直接攻读博士学位研究生（<span>5</span>年制）。为便于推免生申请，特制定本通知，具体安排如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span><span>  </span></span><span>在满足我校接收推免生的相关要求基础上，要求推免生必须掌握光学工程学科的基础课程（涵盖考研初试、复试相关课程）。</span></p><p><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span>、审核流程</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>）审核时间：申请人在完成信息采集后，学科将定期审核（<strong>报名截止时间：<span>2025</span>年<span>9</span>月<span>10</span>日</strong>）。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>）通知形式：通过信息采集系统或邮箱（<strong><span>见下面各方向邮箱</span></strong>）通知学生审核通过情况。</span></p><p><strong><span>3</span></strong><strong><span>、面试安排</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>）面试时间、地点（以通知为准）</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>）面试所需携带材料按学校要求。</span></p><p><strong><span>4</span></strong><strong><span>、联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span>联系人：董老师（光学工程：光子学与光电子技术；</span></p><p><span>电子信息：光电子信息工程）</span></p><p><span>邮箱：<span><a href=\"mailto:dong19809@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">dong19809@163.com</a></span></span></p><p><span>联系人：王老师（光学工程：光电信息智能处理；</span></p><p><span>电子信息：光电信息工程）</span></p><p><span>邮箱：<span><a href=\"mailto:wangzhile@hit.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wangzhile@hit.edu.cn</a></span></span></p><p><span>其他未尽事宜按学校相关文件及规定执行。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>  </span></span><span><span>                        </span></span><span>哈尔滨工业大学光学工程学科</span></p><p><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span><span>7月</span><span>8日</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"544dc28160d589cf9749c1988659709bd6944185613432fdc2b83729636e1c51","textLength":436,"sourceSha256":"720c95ac2e58691f8f09539aa82f5ceb6b7e5850b4fdb478ae1ddf85b30e8650","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3297c9674fdffad9ab16","title":"2025年哈尔滨工业大学航天学院光学工程学科2026年推免生（含直博生）报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:55.650133+00:00"}
